Hi,

as promised I have now added the basic macros for galley formatting onto =
the
web site. So this now can actually be used and you could apply the
justification templates etc and put them to a test.

you will find the following new files on
www.latex-project.org/code/experimental/galley:

 galley2.dtx  documented source of the low-level interface
 galley2.ins  unpacker for galley2 and xhj
 xhj-test.tex a short test file playing around with justification =
templates.

I will probably add some real applications (xinitials and xlists) making =
use
of the galley stuff throughout tomorrow.

hope this interface (now productive) spawns some further discussion. =
There are
certainly a lot of open questions being posed in the file galley2.dtx =
--- so I
hope to receive your comments to the mechanism in the next days

good night
frank

